# Code:	ParticleCounterHEV02, Geant4.10.1.03, data library G4NDL4.5
# Moderator:	Version Oct17 and later
# Clovers:	Model 2, position 58 mm from detector center. Compatible with setup using AIDA.
# Source:	Point source at the center of the moderator, isotropic emission
# Last update:	14Dic21
# Comments:	Calculation includes correction for active volume in tube types RIKEN and UPC. 
#	Validation against experimental data for 252Cf from 2018. Details in bit08Oct21.
# Calculations by M. Pallas & A. Tarifeno-Saldivia	
